#
# Keyword parameter container. Wraps parallel key/value Memory<T> buffers.
# Constructed by the compiler at call sites for Type name{} parameters.
# Implements ImmutableMapping which inherits Map, Collection, and Iterable.
# Mutation methods are no-ops since this container is immutable after construction.
#
# This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
# it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by
